  skos:definition "A short code or abbreviation used by the IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology for an ecosystem class. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
<https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/level_number> rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty ; 
  rdfs:label "level number"@en ; 
  skos:definition "The numerical level assigned to a class within the IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology hierarchy. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
