  rdfs:label "Assisted Biotic Migration Filter"@en ; 
  skos:definition "An anthropogenic filter involving managed or incidental translocation, introduction, or movement of organisms, microbes, invertebrates, propagules, or other biota. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
