  dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en> ; 
  rdfs:label "Autotroph Trait"@en ; 
  skos:definition "A species-level trait describing autotroph characteristics, such as differentiated organs, phenology, microbial autotrophy, simple organisms, or absence of autotrophs. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
