  rdfs:label "Biogenic Structure Trait"@en ; 
  skos:definition "An ecosystem-level trait describing ecosystem structure created by organisms, such as stratified vegetation, biofilms, aquatic strata, plant or animal foundations, or absence of biogenic structure. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
