  skos:definition "An ambient environmental filter involving ultraviolet-B radiation and its influence along altitudinal, latitudinal, depth, or turbidity gradients. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
<https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Volcanism_Regime> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual, <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Disturbance_Regime_Filter> ; 
  dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en> ; 
  rdfs:label "Volcanism Regime"@en ; 
  skos:definition "A disturbance regime filter involving volcanism and volcanic effects on nutrients, chemical energy, lava tube systems, particulate matter, or regime shifts. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
<https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Water_Conservation_Trait> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual, <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Species_Level_Trait> ; 
  dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en> ; 
  rdfs:label "Water Conservation Trait"@en ; 
  skos:definition "A species-level trait describing morphological, dietary, digestive, life-history, physiological, or behavioural adaptations that promote water conservation or retention. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
<https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Water_Extraction_Diversion_And_Impoundment_Filter> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual, <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Anthropogenic_Filter> ; 
  dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en> ; 
  rdfs:label "Water Extraction, Diversion, and Impoundment Filter"@en ; 
  skos:definition "An anthropogenic filter involving water extraction, diversion, impoundment, desiccation, flooding, altered flows, altered filling regimes, or reduced freshwater inflows. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
<https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Water_Filter> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual, <https://www.michaeldebellis.com/iucn/Resource_Filter> ; 
  dcterms:source <https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en> ; 
  rdfs:label "Water Filter"@en ; 
  skos:definition "A resource filter involving the availability, movement, surplus, deficit, or limitation of water. From IUCN Global Ecosystem Typology 2.0 DOI: https://doi.org/10.2305/IUCN.CH.2020.13.en."@en . 
